{"1757920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Astral Flux", "steam_appid": 1757920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>FREE UPDATES HAVE EXPANDED THE WORLD OF ASTRAL FLUX</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1757920/extras/aec04b0b5f15c7077cf8dc3725e6ad70.poster.avif?t=1772793893\" width=566 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1757920/extras/aec04b0b5f15c7077cf8dc3725e6ad70.webm?t=1772793893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1757920/extras/aec04b0b5f15c7077cf8dc3725e6ad70.mp4?t=1772793893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Submerged</strong> - Travel to a brand-new planet filled with ancient horrors and discover dangerous new enemies that lurk in the water.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1757920/extras/df9429ab3f9ec23c8367749293026900.poster.avif?t=1772793893\" width=566 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1757920/extras/df9429ab3f9ec23c8367749293026900.webm?t=1772793893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1757920/extras/df9429ab3f9ec23c8367749293026900.mp4?t=1772793893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Artifact Hunter</strong> - Face world destroyers who obliterate everything in your path and unearth powerful artifacts that survive beyond death. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1757920/extras/2beaebbbebac89ae7e3f82b0b2c816ee.poster.avif?t=1772793893\" width=566 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1757920/extras/2beaebbbebac89ae7e3f82b0b2c816ee.webm?t=1772793893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Balance of Power</strong> - Grow in strength with new tools that will aid in your survival and conquer improved challenge rooms.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Astral Flux is an action-platformer with roguelite elements. Join two scrappers who are lost in space and find themselves caught up in an intergalactic mystery. Traverse hostile alien planets, discover dark secrets, and face powerful foes in combat. Death is inevitable, but it’s only the beginning. Carve a new path forward using the knowledge from your previous attempts. You’ll need to sharpen your skills to unravel this mystery.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1757920/extras/d5772dde82a16944474db5091676650b.poster.avif?t=1772793893\" width=566 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1757920/extras/d5772dde82a16944474db5091676650b.webm?t=1772793893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1757920/extras/d5772dde82a16944474db5091676650b.mp4?t=1772793893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Terrifying Beauty</strong> - Travel to distant dimensions and explore ancient alien ruins. The galaxy holds many secrets for you to discover.<br></li><li><strong>Randomized Levels</strong> – Death changes the world around you and no two runs are the same. To survive you must upgrade your skills and abilities on the way.<br></li><li><strong>Otherworldly Creatures</strong> – Fight or evade dangerous enemies across different planets.<br></li><li><strong>Challenge Rooms</strong> - Procedurally generated combat challenges reward you with powerful upgrades.<br></li><li><strong>Free Updates</strong> – The world of Astral Flux has been expanded with free updates like Submerged, Balance of Power and Artifact Hunter.</li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Astral Flux is an action-platformer with roguelite elements. Join two scrappers who are lost in space and find themselves caught up in an intergalactic mystery. Traverse hostile alien planets, discover dark secrets, and face powerful foes in combat. Death is inevitable, but it’s only the beginning. Carve a new path forward using the knowledge from your previous attempts. You’ll need to sharpen your skills to unravel this mystery.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1757920/extras/d5772dde82a16944474db5091676650b.poster.avif?t=1772793893\" width=566 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1757920/extras/d5772dde82a16944474db5091676650b.webm?t=1772793893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1757920/extras/d5772dde82a16944474db5091676650b.mp4?t=1772793893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Terrifying Beauty</strong> - Travel to distant dimensions and explore ancient alien ruins. The galaxy holds many secrets for you to discover.<br></li><li><strong>Randomized Levels</strong> – Death changes the world around you and no two runs are the same. To survive you must upgrade your skills and abilities on the way.<br></li><li><strong>Otherworldly Creatures</strong> – Fight or evade dangerous enemies across different planets.<br></li><li><strong>Challenge Rooms</strong> - Procedurally generated combat challenges reward you with powerful upgrades.<br></li><li><strong>Free Updates</strong> – The world of Astral Flux has been expanded with free updates like Submerged, Balance of Power and Artifact Hunter.</li></ul>", "short_description": "Astral Flux is an action-platformer with roguelite elements where each run is different. Traverse hostile alien planets, discover dark secrets, and face powerful foes in combat.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Traditional Chinese, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1757920/header.jpg?t=1772793893", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1757920/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772793893", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1757920/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772793893", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual-core 2.4 Ghz or faster<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1 GB dedicated VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "rec